      "note": "The code reads str[8] without first verifying the string is at least 9 characters long. When the time substring is shorter than 9 bytes (e.g. '12:34' is 5 chars + NUL), str[8] reads beyond the NUL terminator into uninitialized heap memory allocated by icalmemory_new_buffer (malloc, not zeroed). The missing safety obligation is that the string length must be >= 9 before indexing str[8]."
